    "description": "Nested replication inside a concatenation source.\n\nThe concatenation {2{3{Sign}}, In} nests a replication inside a\nreplication (2*3 = 6 copies of Sign) and appends the 2-bit payload,\nforming an 8-bit word wired straight to the output. Pins that\nreplication composes with itself and with a plain item in one `{ }`\nconcat (shdl.md §6.5.1, §13). Bits 1-2 are In, bits 3-8 are Sign.",
